            "text": "```python\nimport numpy as np\n\ndef main():\n    X = np.load(\"vectors_secondary.npy\", mmap_mode=\"r\")\n    N = X.shape[0]\n\n    sq_norms = np.empty(N, dtype=np.float64)\n    for i in range(0, N, 1000):\n        sq_norms[i : i + 1000] = np.sum(\n            X[i : i + 1000].astype(np.float64) ** 2, axis=1\n        )\n\n    total_half_sum = 0.0\n    B = 400\n\n    for i in range(0, N, B):\n        i_end = min(i + B, N)\n        b = i_end - i\n\n        dot = X[i:i_end] @ X[i:].T\n        d2 = sq_norms[i:i_end, None] + sq_norms[None, i:] - 2.0 * dot\n        np.maximum(d2, 0.0, out=d2)\n        np.sqrt(d2, out=d2)\n\n        total_half_sum += np.sum(np.triu(d2[:, :b], k=1))\n        if b < d2.shape[1]:\n            total_half_sum += np.sum(d2[:, b:])\n\n    total_sum = 2.0 * total_half_sum\n    print(f\"TOTAL:{total_sum}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
